lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nZhao Li and her friend Wang Qiang complete a project together. The manager praises the entire project team at the annual meeting, but only promotes Wang Qiang. \\nZhao Li says to Wang Qiang: \"I am really happy, congratulations, you really deserve this promotion!\" When she goes home at night, Zhao Li says to her sister: \"I am disappointed, I can't believe I am treated like this.\"\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Zhao Li say she is both happy and disappointed?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. She is happy that the entire group gets praised, but is disappointed that she does not get promoted.\nB. She is happy that Wang Qiang gets promoted, but is disappointed that her efforts are not recognized.\nC. She is happy that Wang Qiang gets promoted, but is disappointed and jealous of him.\nD. She is happy that the entire group gets praised, but is disappointed that Wang Qiang does not thank her for her help.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0019266883345733688,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52a53c2ddb05a7fe2dcf2","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452051493,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:54:11","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"ac14d0ba74b049c885c303a335b36580"}